# Only track the public surface of this repo: start/stop scripts and README.
# Everything else here is machine-local state from running the server.

# Ignore everything by default…
/*

# …except the files we want on GitHub:
!.gitignore
!/start.sh
!/stop.sh
!/README.md

# Machine-local runtime state produced by start.sh / stop.sh (belt & suspenders;
# already covered by the /* ignore above):
#   .sglang.pid       — running container ID
#   .sglang.log       — launch log
#   .sglang-persist/  — optional host-side SGLang install
#   sglang_storage/   — server file storage (tool uploads)
